window.products.push({"id":998155,"name":"StarLifey Artificial Flowers, Bride Rose Flowers for Bridal Wedding Bouquet, Birthday Flowers Bunch Hotel Party Decor Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HMeNMZnCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"StarLifey Lifelike Silk Roses --Simple but not tedium,all show fashion atmosphere elegant noble quality of life.You deserve these beautiful natural-looking roses.Perfect for your wedding day for bridal bouquet, construct a flower crown,make hair accessories for a wedding,craft projects,make a beautiful table floral arrangement or just make your own beautiful display. Increase more color and vitality to your life ,make you have a good mood every day. Specification: Flower arrangement:1 vase should buy 2 bunch of roses.Material:Silk Cloth, Plastic, Iron Wire.Package:10 pieces silk roses in one bag.Color:Red, white,champagne,blue,pink,yellow.Size:Total length 16.9 inches, flower diameter 2.75 inches. Note: 1.This faux flower are made by handmade and machine.And there are a little glue that leave on the leaf, you can cut it. It is not quality problem.2.When you receive these roses, the stems are bent to pack for shipping so some flowers may be smooshed a little. You can easily fluff the flowers back up,separate the vines to look more natural.3.Due to packing and transportation, a few flowers may become loose or fall off. You can easily push the flowers back onto the stems.It can also be used hot melt adhesive fixed.4.Don't put artificial roses expose under the sun for a long time, or they will lose their bright colors and became increasingly bleak.5.Item color displayed in photos may be showing slightly different on your computer monitor since monitors are not calibrated same. Tips: 1.There would be accumulated dust if you put it in a place for very long time, You can use the hair dryer with cold wind to remove the dust.2.If it was seriously dirty, you could sink it into salt water with high concentration for 10 minutes and then add neutral detergent and then rinse twice.3.We suggest that you don't need to wash it by hands and don't wash too frequently. It will fade if wash frequently.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HMeNMZnCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"StarLifey","source_asin":"B0777H63MX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-998155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0777H63MX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0777H63MX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
