window.products.push({"id":998197,"name":"Tangkula 1500W Electric Space Heater, Oil Filled Radiator Heater with 3 Heat Settings & Adjustable Thermostat, Overheat & Tip-Over Protection, Radiant","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z3fdvK97L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥300 Sq.Ft. Heating Range & Adjuetable Thermostat🔥: The radiator heater adopts a unique design and the heating effect is 1.5 times that of ordinary oil, heating up to the area up to 300 sq.ft. 3 Heating modes (600W, 900W and 1500W) with adjustable thermostat keep your room always in a suitable temperature for long-lasting comfort. ❤️Energy Saving & Quiet Working❤️: The oil heater creates a soothing and warm atmosphere for you to relax, and won’t make out any disturbing sounds. And there is no wind or dazzling light during operation, so you can sleep at ease. Furthermore, the heater is designed with a permanently-sealed oil reservoir, and thus you don’t need to refill oil, which is quite energy-saving. 🔥Double Protection Design🔥: This space heater boasts not only high efficiency, but also high-level safety. When the tipping angle reaches 45° or the temperature is too high, the heater will turn off automatically. Such a double protection design with ETL certification will ensure your safety during usage. ❤️Humidification Box & Towel Rack Included❤️: The humidification box on the back is functional to prevent the air in the room from being too dry. 2 hanging towel racks and a cup holder are equipped for more convenience to put towels and drinks. Additionally, the cord storage box keeps the cords well-organized. 🔥Suitable Size for Indoor🔥: Measuring 17” x 10.5” x 27” (L x W x H), this radiant heater with slim shape won’t take up too much space of your room. The 4 universal casters and convenient handle allow you to move the heater without effort. This space heater is ideal for multiple indoor occasions, such as bedroom, living room and office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61z3fdvK97L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tangkula","source_asin":"B0BDMK2C5X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-998197","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDMK2C5X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDMK2C5X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
