window.products.push({"id":998367,"name":"Bekrvio Bamboo Shoe Bench, 2 Tier Entryway Shoe Storage Rack, Upholstered Organizer Shelf with Padded Cushion Seat, Shoe Changing Bench Stool for Livi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aYDCzGg4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1、【Natural Bamboo Material】: This shoe bench is made of high quality bamboo wood which features a brown finish and smooth surface, environmentally friendly and durable. It matches any entryway or room with its classic and long lasting appearance. 2、【Comfortable & Study Structure】: This accent bench is constructed with a thick bamboo frame, a solid bottom slat shelf makes it more sturdy, and a soft padded seat cushion which is crafted of high-quality upholstery and filled with high-density foam ensures a comfortable sitting when you change shoes, it is removable and easy to clean. The bench can support up to 350lb. 3、【Space Saving & Dimension】: overall measuring 35.4” W x 11.8” D x 17.7” H, with a bottom shelf (28.3\"L x 10.2”W x 8.7”H) provides a storage rack to organize your shoes (holds up to 4 pairs of shoes). You can also use the shelf to store other accessories such as umbrella, baskets, magazines, and plants. 4、【Multi-functional】: It is not only perfect as a shoe rack at the entrance or bedside but also used as a comfortable sitting bench when you put on or take your shoe off. This can be placed anywhere in your home, kitchen, bathroom, dressing room, changing room, laundry room, bedroom, living room, front doorway or outside. 5、【Easy to Assemble & IMPORTANT】: NOTE: The shoe bench seat screws are self-tapping screws that must be screwed in. There are NO holes designed for the seat cushion. When the leg frame is assembled, just screw the seat cushion directly into the holes on the frame. Easy-to-follow instructions and hardware are included, so you can easily assemble it. For any issues or concerns, please feel free to contact us, your satisfaction is guaranteed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aYDCzGg4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bekrvio","source_asin":"B09YTWP8J7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-998367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YTWP8J7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YTWP8J7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
