window.products.push({"id":998437,"name":"Studio Oh! Mini Box of Recipes, Royal-Tea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aYyUd0GUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you’re not descended from British Royalty there’s a good chance the whole concept of “taking tea” is probably, well, foreign. Never fear! While butter and scones and jam and little fancy cakes are nice, it’s really all about taking a quiet moment, either alone or with a friend, and enjoying a well-made cup of tea (minus the fancy hat, white gloves and raised pinky finger). Studio Oh!’s Tea Time Mini Box of Recipes is a glorious array of 20 delicious recipes designed to sooth, invigorate, inspire and delight. The recipes come complete with detailed instructions, a guide to brewing techniques and an interesting and informative blurb about the recipe; each has been carefully chosen for creativity and satisfying results. The recipe cards are imaginatively illustrated with a whimsical vintage collage and the box is embellished with foil stamping. One lump or two? The passionate and creative designers at Studio Oh! believe that products should not only be relevant to the needs of today’s consumers but also should be environmentally responsible, infused with energy, elevated design, richly-saturated colors and fine craftsmanship. From beautiful calendars loaded with super functional planning features, stationery and journals that move and inspire to home and kitchen accessories with plain-old-amazing designs, Studio Oh! invites you to explore their extraordinary products available on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aYyUd0GUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Studio Oh!","source_asin":"B005IZOGQG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-998437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005IZOGQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005IZOGQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
