window.products.push({"id":998674,"name":"5 Tier Metal Small Shoe Rack for Closet Organizer,17.7\"L*12\"W*34.6\"H Corner Shoe Shelf for Entryway Free Standing Shoe Racks for Bedroom Closet Shoe S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wQ7PIIwBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Space-Saving Shoes Rack Organizer】Small shoe rack with compact vertical design, the vertical shoe rack occupies little space but provides plenty of storage space. Each tier of shelf could fit 2 pairs of adult shoes. So it can almost store about 10 pairs of shoes. Otherwise, the closet shoe organizer with 5 versatile hooks, you can hang keys, umbrellas, bags, etc, It is a a very practical design which can organized your shoes tidy and save more space in your house. 【Stackable & Detachable Shelf Organizer】The 5-tier shoe storage rack can be split into 2 ~ 5-tier racks. With the stackable function and space-saving profile of the shoe rack for entryway, you even can buy two sets to create a larger capacity 10-tier tall shoe rack that fits your space. 【Easy Assembly Shoes Organizer】This shoe shelf for closet is very easy to install, no screw required, simply assemble the unit by the provided mallet, easy to assemble and easy to configure to your needs. Save a lot of time for you! 【Multifunctional Shoe Rack】Our closet shoe rack can be added or removed tiers as needed. You can remove one layer to fit boots or high heels. This outdoor shoe rack is not only for shoes, but also for tiny things, such as books, plants, CD, toys, towel, sundries and small accessories. Perfectly storage for your closet, entryway, dormitory, bedroom, garage etc. 【Durable & Sturdy Shoes Shelf】Our 5 tier shoe rack is made of thickened metal pipes and plastic connectors making it sturdy enough to hold all of your shoes. The short design of shelf pipes are hard to bend even placing larger or heavy objects, which makes this free standing shoe racks more sturdy, stabler and longer lifetime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wQ7PIIwBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POPMISOLER","source_asin":"B09KRJS39Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-998674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KRJS39Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KRJS39Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":998675,"name":"Diva At Home 3.25' x 5.25' Geometric Abstract Gray & Midnight Blue Hand Tufted Wool Throw Rug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GW909puuL._AC_.jpg","description":"From the Dream Collection With sophisticated and timeless designs, the Dream Collection features a series of traditional rug designs reflecting the colors and patterns of our time Color(s): midnight blue and pigeon gray Hand tufted plush high/low pile Design may vary slightly due to the hand crafted nature of this rug Dimensions: 3.25' wide x 5.25' long Material(s): wool Note: photo shows a 5' x 8' rug, however this listing is for a 3.25' x 5.25' rug Our hand crafted rugs are meticulously hooked, woven and tufted by skilled artisans with the power to transform an ordinary space into something spectacular. Created in northeastern India by local weavers, these intricate rugs provide a livelihood to villagers, particularly women who have been traditionally excluded from opportunities in Indiaâ€s workforce. The elaborate process takes several artisans to complete, beginning with patterns that are hand traced and colored. Dependent on which highly detailed construction is chosen for a rug design, it can take anywhere from one week to over six months to complete one of these expertly crafted masterpieces. A portion of the profits from these rugs and pillows goes towards a school lunch program that serves fresh, nutritious daily meals to 1.3 million children in rural India. For many children, this is their only substantial meal of the day. Additional donations are also made to a scholarship program that enhances literacy and learning in Southeast Asia. Nearly 80 percent of children from impoverished families drop out before graduation due to the burden of educational fees, books and uniforms. This program helps compensate for all school expenses in addition to mandating and paying for after-school tutoring for students most in need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GW909puuL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Diva At Home","source_asin":"B00CWDQB3S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-998675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CWDQB3S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CWDQB3S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
