window.products.push({"id":998741,"name":"Number-one Air Fryer Silicone Pot for Ninja Foodi Dual DZ201, 2PCS Reusable Air Fryer Silicone Liners with Handles Heat Resistant Air Fryer Basket for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pwRUxwZKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Double Silicone Air Fryer Pot】-Our silicone pots for Ninja Foodi Dual air fryer have two separate silicone baskets, ideal for cooking different foods or double servings. They are made of food-grade silicone, which is heat-resistant, oil proof, non-stick and reusable. Compared to parchment paper liners, our silicone liners can be used many of times without deformation or damage, which is more eco-friendly. The air fryer baskets will serve your family a safe, healthy, and low-fat fried meals. 【Heat Resistance Air Fryer Liners】-Our air fryer silicone pot have high heat resistance, withstanding temperatures up to 428°F and down to -40°F. Whether you are baking or freezing, they will be ideal choice. Suitable for all kinds of cookware such as microwave ovens, steamers and ovens etc. 【Easy To Clean】-These air fryer accessories are are very soft, flexible and non-stick, you can flip the silicone pot over inside out to pour out food residues and dirt. After cooking, just wash the air fryer lining by hand or put it in the dishwasher. Using our silicone air fryer baskets will make your fryer cleaning even easier. 【Practical Design】-Our silicone liner for the air fryer is designed with hollow handles on both sides to protect your hands from burns when taking out it. The bottom texture design ensures airflow for even heat distribution to cook your food crispy! And it helps the oil in the food flow to the edge of the tray while cooking, preventing the food from being soaked in oil. 【Wide Application 】-The dimension of air fryer liners is 7.87*5*2.75 inch. Suitable for 8 QT double basket air fryers. It is compatible with Ninja brand DZ201, DZ401, DZ550, AF400 models of air fryers. The silicone pots can be used for microwave baking, air frying, steamer liners, also used as a cake mold and fruit plate. Suitable for daily home baking, camping, barbecues and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pwRUxwZKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Number-One","source_asin":"B0BB7KWRKY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-998741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB7KWRKY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB7KWRKY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
