window.products.push({"id":998751,"name":"SHERWAY 2 Panels 5 feet x 10 feet Wrinkle-Free Navy Blue Sheer Backdrop Curtain for Wedding Ceremony Party Arch Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HVZAsAMNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SHERWAY’s Talk Little change, big difference.  Every decoration makes life wonderful.  We make backdrop curtains with our heart, including every fabric, every little detail.  Thank you for always enjoyed our products. SHERWAY Gauze Backdrop Curtain Series It's soft, sheer, chic and rustic.  Perfect for vintage wedding backdrop, baby shower backdrop, bridal shower backdrop, engagement party backdrop, birthday party backdrop and home daily use.  Sheer backdrop curtain is pretty but needs your careful maintenance. Please don’t place on rough place. Specification Material: 100% Polyester  Total size: Approx. 10 x 10 feet (W x L). Manual measurement (error range: 0.5-1.5 inches) 100% Handmade Backdrop Curtain 100% hand-cut & hand-stitching items. Slight errors in size and color is normal due to different fabric batches.  Sheer backdrop curtain will shrink slightly after be launched into water. Roughly 3 to 5 percent, which is normal. Care Instruction Machine wash in laundry bag or hand wash in cold water with mild detergent. Hanging dry, do not twist. Package Include 2 x backdrop curtains (Include 2 panels, each panel measures approx. 5 feet wide by 10 feet long including rod pocket. Rod pocket: 4 inch.)  2 x ribbon ties (other accessories are NOT included) Color Difference The colors of the item may vary slightly due to different computer monitor settings. Fully Inspection We did fully inspection before shipping.  If any question or suggestion, please do not hesitate to contact us by mail.  Will try our best to satisfy every customer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HVZAsAMNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHERWAY","source_asin":"B08934XK8C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-998751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08934XK8C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08934XK8C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":998752,"name":"eLuxurySupply 300 Thread Count - Long Staple Cotton Bed Skirt, Twin, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41souQeDZpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Our 100% Egyptian Cotton Sheets cannot be beaten when it comes to the price. You will not find better quality at a better price! They're available in multiple size ranges and colors making up almost 200 options! Whether the sheets are a gift for a friend or you are buying for yourself, you know you are getting top-quality luxury with Exceptional Sheets. Egyptian Cotton Why is Egyptian cotton so much better for your sheets? Quite simply, Egyptian cotton produces longer fibers (up to twice as long as a standard cotton fiber). The longer fibers or staples are easily spun into finer count yarns, and turned into the softest sheets you will ever sleep on. It's that simple! Single Ply: \"Ply\" refers to the number of yarns wrapped together in a single thread. The process of plying creates thicker threads, which will impact a sheet's feel and durability. Finer threads allow for higher thread counts resulting in a softer sheet with an elegant drape. Our Single ply sheets use individual, un-plied threads in the weaving process, resulting in lighter-weight fabric with exceptional drape and softness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41souQeDZpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ExceptionalSheets","source_asin":"B00I3OGU4U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-998752","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I3OGU4U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I3OGU4U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
