window.products.push({"id":998799,"name":"All-Clad LTD2 1-1/2-Quart Sauce Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pXFDPHYPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Distinguished among All-Clad's renowned cookware collections by its stylish, charcoal black, hard-anodized aluminum exterior, the LTD2 line--the second generation of LTD--provides serious and professional cooks with all the virtues that make All-Clad's worldwide reputation unsurpassed. Key to its high performance is a five-ply, bonded construction that consists of an anodized-aluminum exterior, then a thick layer of pure aluminum, followed by a layer of 18/10 stainless steel, then another thick layer of pure aluminum, and an interior layer of 18/10 stainless steel--all of which spreads heat evenly across the bottoms of pots and pans and all the way up the sides. The cookware's striking exterior resists stains and abrasion, while its corrosion-resistant interior is nonreactive, so tomatoes and other acidic foods won't taste metallic. This 1-1/2-quart sauce pan makes clear why All-Clad's LTD2 cookware is so popular among contemporary cooks. It's 6 inches in diameter and 3-1/5 inches deep, perfect for making homemade marinara sauce, cooking noodles, heating soup, and much more. Oven-safe up to 500 degrees F, the cookware's polished stainless-steel lid fits evenly with the pan's edges to seal in flavor, and its long, polished stainless-steel handle comes secured with sturdy, non-corrosive rivets and stays cool to the touch on the stovetop. LTD2 cookware carries a limited lifetime warranty and cleans easily by hand or in the dishwasher (washing by hand recommended).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pXFDPHYPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All-Clad","source_asin":"B0028RY5AO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-998799","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0028RY5AO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0028RY5AO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
