window.products.push({"id":998963,"name":"Vinarie by Nucucina Premium Wine Aerator Pourer And Bottle Stopper Set - Aerate Red Wine In Seconds - Modern Bar Accessory - Easy To Use And Wash - St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lHmXOX-gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Vinarie Wine Aerator and Bottle Stopper Set by Nucucina is for every person who drinks wine and who wants to enjoy its true flavor without waiting. Here's a huge problem you face right now. It's wasting time by decanting wine traditionally . Many wine lovers can't also get past the idea that they have to buy expensive aerators to enjoy a perfect bottle of wine . All of these extra steps of making a perfect wine can be a nightmare! But luckily for you, there's now a solution! The Vinarie Wine Aerator and Bottle Stopper Set by Nucucina is the best and the most simple wine aerator pourer that you have been looking for! It doubles the value of your wine by enhancing its aroma and flavor. It even makes a cheaper bottle of wine smoother and tastier! It pours incredibly well and no mess. Say goodbye to those wine stains! The incorporated bottle stopper is an added bonus to preserve that wine bottle of yours for a few extra days. This fancy bar tool set is also gift-ready, makes a perfect surprise for your wine drinking husband or wife . Give it as a house-warming gift or take it to any wine or cheese party and share this amazing tool to your family and friends. You’ll definitely wish you have gotten them sooner! The manufacturer, Nucucina, is offering a 2-year warranty. If for any reason you are not completely satisfied with your purchase, simply contact the manufacturer for a hassle-free refund or replacement. Also, by purchasing this product, you are taking part in our Buy One Feed One Program. For every product purchase, we will provide a meal to a child in a developing country. Don't hesitate - now is the time - have a great conversation piece and enhance your guest's drinking experience! - Order Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lHmXOX-gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nucucina","source_asin":"B01MY11G86","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-998963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MY11G86","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MY11G86","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":998964,"name":"P46 Digital Wooden Digital Clock, Blue LED and Bamboo Color, with Alarm Clock, Date and Tempature, Wood Look Digital Clock, Unique Design for Clocks w","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YtW8UL6xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to use: Time Setting: In the clock mode, press SET for a long time to enter into 12/24 mode.  Once 12/24 flashes, press UP/DOWN to switch and press SET again to enter into clock setting.  Once the clock flashes, press UP/DOWN to adjust the hour value and press SET again.  Once the minute flashes, press UP/DOWN to adjust the minute value and press SET again to finish the time setting. Date and Alarm Setting: In the clock mode, press SET momentarily to enter into date display.  Press SET for a long time to enter into date setting. Once the year flashes, press UP/DOWN adjust the year and press SET again.  Once the month flashes, press UP/DOWN to adjust the month and press SET again.  Once the day flashes, press UP/DOWN to adjust the day and press SET again to finish the date setting.  Press SET to enter into alarm time to set A1 alarm.  Press UP to set A1 to \"ON\" or \"--\". When set to \"ON\", press SET for a long time.  Once the alarm flashes, press UP/DOWN to adjust the hour and press SET again.  Once the minute flashes, press UP/DOWN to adjust the minute.  Press SET again to enter into A2 and A3 settings and repeat steps above. Modes: When the clock is on the time and date state, press UP to switch the mode to dP-1, dP-2 and dP-3 dP1 displays the time and date alternately with the time displayed for 10 seconds and the date displayed for 3 seconds.  dP2 maintains the current display set dP3 displays time only Temperature Display Setting: The default temperature is Celsius In the normal mode, press DOWN for a long time to switch temperature unit to either Celsius or Fahrenheit.  The clock measures and updates the temperature every 60 seconds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YtW8UL6xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"P46 Digital","source_asin":"B06XRW1LY9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-998964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XRW1LY9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XRW1LY9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
