window.products.push({"id":998986,"name":"Espresso Level Tamper Coffee Palm Tamper in Stainless steel, heavy 58mm weight is 1.2 kilogram(2.71 LBS)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hIDQ7vD1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Espresso Tamping is an art that is often neglected in espresso preparation. The goal is to create a pellet of coffee through which the hot water from the espresso machine will penetrate evenly. Since the water from the espresso machine is under pressure, the espresso pellet must be hard and evenly tamped. The water only knows how to go from a region of high pressure to a region of low pressure. Therefore it is important to prevent paths of least resistance in the coffee pellet and force the water to evenly permeate and extract the coffee. This height is adjustable and it has a diameter of 58mm, suit different baskets, so we wish from our products, you can enjoy your coffee time","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hIDQ7vD1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"[JOEFREX]","source_asin":"B072MZ9D96","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-998986","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072MZ9D96","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072MZ9D96","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
